   <media:description>Some stories stay with us. Others are waiting to be discovered.
At #ValentinoAntibiblioteca, Brand Ambassadors and Friends of the Maison share the books, stories and ideas that have shaped them, sparked their imagination and opened new perspectives.
In the spirit of the Antibiblioteca, each guest was invited to bring a new or pre-owned book to pass on to another reader. The collected books were donated to libraries in Paris and beyond through #BibliothequesSansFrontieres and #FauvettesCityClub.</media:description>
